# Surface Spec: Rust
The set of `fn`, `struct`, `enum`, `trait`, and `impl`
declarations in each file under `## Declarations` must equal the
declarations under that file.

## Declarations

### trait_impls.rs
```rust
pub struct Wrapper<T>(T);

pub struct Raw(*mut u8);

impl<T: Display> Display for Wrapper<T>;

unsafe impl Send for Raw;

impl !Sync for Raw;

impl<T> From<T> for Wrapper<T>
where
    T: Clone,
;

impl<'a, T> Iterator for Wrapper<&'a [T]>;

impl Default for Raw;
```
